{
  "tema": 5215,
  "slug": "di-preterito-dar",
  "titulo": "Dar in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Le di mi número y me dio el suyo.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Dar is an -ar verb, but in the preterite it takes the -er/-ir endings: di, diste, dio, dimos, dieron. Di and dio are one syllable, so they have no written accent.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Dar** ends in -ar, but in the preterite it borrows the **-er/-ir endings**, minus the accents."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "dar",
            "like comer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**di**",
              "comí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "**diste**",
              "comiste"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**dio**",
              "comió"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "**dimos**",
              "comimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ustedes",
              "**dieron**",
              "comieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Di** and **dio** have **one syllable**, so **no written accent**: not dí, dió."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Never the -ar endings: not **dé**, **daste**, **dó**, **daron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Dar** usually comes with an indirect pronoun: **le di**, **me dio**, **nos dieron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **dar** wears **ver**'s clothes in the preterite: **di / vi**, **dio / vio**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Le ==di== mi número a la vecina.",
              "en": "I gave the neighbor my number."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Quién te ==dio== esa tabla?",
              "en": "Who gave you that board?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi sensei me ==dio== la cinta azul.",
              "en": "My instructor gave me my blue belt."
            },
            {
              "es": "Le ==dimos== semillas de calabaza a mi tía.",
              "en": "We gave my aunt some squash seeds."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Le ==diste== las gracias?",
              "en": "Did you thank him?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Nos ==dieron== una mesa junto a la ventana.",
              "en": "They gave us a table by the window."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Dimos== una vuelta por el malecón.",
              "en": "We took a stroll along the boardwalk."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
